<item><title>Human rights commission gives education department 60 days to act on school crisis</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/human-rights-commission-gives-education-department-60-days-b74020/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/human-rights-commission-gives-education-department-60-days-b74020/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The commission cited overcrowding, unsafe buildings and sanitation failures in public schools, with its report recording classes of up to 101 learners.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:21:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/human-rights-commission-gives-education-department-60-days-b74020/share.jpg" length="43582" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/human-rights-commission-gives-education-department-60-days-b74020/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Witness accuses suspended Johannesburg officer of aiding Molefe&apos;s network</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/witness-accuses-suspended-johannesburg-officer-of-aiding-6f2b2d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/witness-accuses-suspended-johannesburg-officer-of-aiding-6f2b2d/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>At the Madlanga commission, a police officer cited messages that allegedly show Johannes Mokgatle had a role beyond passing information.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:13:15 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Weather service warns three provinces of severe thunderstorms</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/weather-service-warns-three-provinces-of-severe-d803a3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/weather-service-warns-three-provinces-of-severe-d803a3/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The Level 4 alert ran until 23:59 on Monday, with heavy rain, hail and damaging winds forecast across parts of Gauteng, Limpopo and Mpumalanga.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:33:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>TFG workers strike at two Gauteng centres for 94% pay rise</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/tfg-workers-strike-at-two-gauteng-centres-for-94-pay-rise-48519b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/tfg-workers-strike-at-two-gauteng-centres-for-94-pay-rise-48519b/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>Hundreds downed tools at the retailer’s Kempton Park and Midrand distribution centres after wage negotiations stalled.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:43:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Johannesburg council delays mayor vote to Friday amid coalition talks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-council-delays-mayor-vote-to-friday-amid-2c295b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-council-delays-mayor-vote-to-friday-amid-2c295b/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>ActionSA leader Herman Mashaba is in line for the post, while the Democratic Alliance has challenged the council sitting as negotiations continue.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:27:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
